  "title": "The Film-Loving Ghost Miko",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Film-Loving_Ghost_Miko?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The Film-Loving Ghost Miko</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Event_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Event Quests\">Event Quests</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Event</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Flaming_Red_in_Memory\" title=\"The Flaming Red in Memory\">The Flaming Red in Memory</a>[[Category:|000000]]</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">You catch wind of a “Film-Loving Ghost Miko” urban legend in the Academy's group chat. You decide to head to the screening room to check it out.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Rescued_Researcher\" title=\"The Rescued Researcher\">The Rescued Researcher</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Soliskin_and_Its_Mysterious_Friend\" title=\"A Soliskin and Its Mysterious Friend\">A Soliskin and Its Mysterious Friend</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Platya\" title=\"Platya\">Platya</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>The Film-Loving Ghost Miko</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Event_Quest\" title=\"Event Quest\">Event Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Square\" title=\"Square\">Square</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Startorch_Academy_(Region)\" title=\"Startorch Academy (Region)\">Startorch Academy (Region)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Roya_Frostlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Roya Frostlands\">Roya Frostlands</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Talk to Platya</li>\n<li>Read the Wavesline messages in the group chat to find clues</li>\n<li>Talk to Platya</li>\n<li>Wait until 11:00 PM</li>\n<li>Head to the Screening Room</li>\n<li>Talk to Platya</li>\n<li>Sit by Platya</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Platya)</dt>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Speaking of which, we've only been chasing footprints she left in the past. I know very little about her present.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Any ideas, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)? How do we track down her current location?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Give me a second.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> There might be clues in the student group chat.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Read the Wavesline messages in the group chat to find clues)</dt>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/4a/Phone_System_Notification_Exclaimation_Point.png/revision/latest?cb=20260312050123\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Phone System Notification Exclaimation Point\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Phone System Notification Exclaimation Point.png\" data-image-key=\"Phone_System_Notification_Exclaimation_Point.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/4a/Phone_System_Notification_Exclaimation_Point.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260312050123\" /></a></span> Ultimate Psych Rep invited (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;) to the group chat</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>My Grim Reaper Classmate Wants My Name</b></dd>\n<dd>OKAY SO did y'all hear?? The Ghost Miko showed up at the Film Club room again. Sometime after 11:00 PM.</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>My Grim Reaper Classmate Wants My Name</b></dd>\n<dd>And she watched THAT film again—\"Leon the Unprofessional\"!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Is this some kind of rule-based creepypasta?\n<dl><dd><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin:3px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center;\" class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"standard-light-background\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 25px; height: 25px; margin-bottom: 3px; border: 2px solid #424c74; box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 3px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\"><img alt=\"Rover\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Resonator Rover.png\" data-image-key=\"Resonator_Rover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/47/Resonator_Rover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240523011434\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\"><img alt=\"Rover\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Resonator Rover.png\" data-image-key=\"Resonator_Rover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/47/Resonator_Rover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240523011434\" /></a></span> </span> <b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)</b></dd>\n<dd>Is this some kind of rule-based creepypasta?</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Tell me more.\n<dl><dd><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin:3px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center;\" class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"standard-light-background\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 25px; height: 25px; margin-bottom: 3px; border: 2px solid #424c74; box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 3px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\"><img alt=\"Rover\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Resonator Rover.png\" data-image-key=\"Resonator_Rover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/47/Resonator_Rover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240523011434\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\"><img alt=\"Rover\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Resonator Rover.png\" data-image-key=\"Resonator_Rover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/47/Resonator_Rover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240523011434\" /></a></span> </span> <b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)</b></dd>\n<dd>Tell me more.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>Ultimate Psych Rep</b></dd>\n<dd>K newbie. Guess you don't know. Aside from Startorch's Seven Great Mysteries, there's the legend of the Film-Loving Ghost Miko.</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>Ultimate Psych Rep</b></dd>\n<dd>They say the Film Club room has a stash of classic DVDs. Late at night, when no one's supposed to be there, you can hear \"clack clack\" sounds from inside...</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>My Grim Reaper Classmate Wants My Name</b></dd>\n<dd>And then, a figure in miko robes just sits in the middle of the room and watches a film. When it's over, the door cam shows no one going in or out.</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>My Grim Reaper Classmate Wants My Name</b></dd>\n<dd>So the only explanation...</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>Ultimate Psych Rep</b></dd>\n<dd>LEVITATING GHOST. Obviously.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Why that film specifically?\n<dl><dd><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin:3px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center;\" class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"standard-light-background\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 25px; height: 25px; margin-bottom: 3px; border: 2px solid #424c74; box-sizing: content-box; border-radius: 3px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\"><img alt=\"Rover\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Resonator Rover.png\" data-image-key=\"Resonator_Rover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/47/Resonator_Rover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240523011434\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display: none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\"><img alt=\"Rover\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Resonator Rover.png\" data-image-key=\"Resonator_Rover.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/47/Resonator_Rover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20240523011434\" /></a></span> </span> <b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)</b></dd>\n<dd>Why is it always \"Leon the Unprofessional\"?</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>My Grim Reaper Classmate Wants My Name</b></dd>\n<dd>Well... maybe the ghost was killed by a hitman! Like, her trauma's so strong she's cursed to rewatch it forever?</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>Ultimate Psych Rep</b></dd>\n<dd>Or she was just really into filsm when she was alive, and now she's dead and bored. Gotta fill the afterlife somehow.</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>Ultimate Psych Rep</b></dd>\n<dd>But either way, newbie, don't think you can go poking around there hoping for a chat.</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>Ultimate Psych Rep</b></dd>\n<dd>We can't guarantee your safety. Wait, what's that line again...??</dd>\n<dd><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest?cb=20260426151735\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"NPC Wavesline\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"NPC Wavesline.png\" data-image-key=\"NPC_Wavesline.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/65/NPC_Wavesline.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20260426151735\" /></a></span> <b>My Grim Reaper Classmate Wants My Name</b></dd>\n<dd>When you gaze into the abyss, the abyss gazes back. Never get too close to legends.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk to Platya)</dt>\n<dt>You catch wind of a \"Film-Loving Ghost Miko\" urban legend in the Academy's group chat. You decide to start investigating there.</dt>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> You mean...</dd>\n<dd><b>(&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;):</b> The people closest to the legend are the ones spreading it, right?</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> True. According to those students, the Lady Miko might appear in the club room after 11:00 tonight. So I was thinking...</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Yes. Even if it's just a legend, I want to try.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), let's meet in the club room after 11:00 tonight.</dd>\n<dt>(Wait until 11:00 PM)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the Screening Room)</dt>\n<dt>(Talk to Platya)</dt>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;), did you see anyone else on your way here?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> No one.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> ...So she didn't come after all.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> I actually got here early, just in case the timing in the legend wasn't exact. But I guess...</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Forget it. Since we're here, we may as well watch this film.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Sit by Platya)</dt>\n<dt>You watch \"Leon the Unprofessional\" with Platya</dt>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> I think the students guessed wrong. The reason the Lady Miko keeps watching this movie... is because she sees herself in the hitman.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> Back in Honami, and now here in Lahai-Roi, her life revolves around the duty to protect. And always at a distance.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> After all these days of investigating, I may not have seen her with my own eyes, but the blurry figure from my memories is slowly becoming clearer.</dd>\n<dd><b>Platya:</b> It's late. Let's call it here for today.</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>The Film-Loving Ghost Miko</td></tr></tbody></table> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/3.2\" title=\"Version/3.2\">Version 3.2</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Film-Loving_Ghost_Miko/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=3.2&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=The+Film-Loving+Ghost+Miko\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div></div>",
